        "text": "=You are the IT Support Team's coordinator. Your task is to collect incoming information about new support tickets and produce a concise summary to email to IT management. The email should be signed with \"IT Support Team.\"\n\nHere are the ticket details:\n\nTicket ID: {{ $json.fields['Ticket ID'] }}\nUser: {{ $json.fields.User }}\nIssue: {{ $json.fields.Issue }}\nPriority: {{ $json.fields.Priority }}\nDate Submitted: {{ $json.fields['Date Submition'] }}\nStatus: {{ $json.fields.Status }}\n\nIMPORTANT: Output ONLY a valid JSON object. Do not include any other text, explanations, or markdown. The JSON must have exactly two keys: \"email_subject\" and \"email_body\". The email_body must contain clean bullet points and be signed with \"IT Support Team\". Use \\n for line breaks inside the email_body string.\n\nExample structure:\n{\n  \"email_subject\": \"Support Ticket Summary: TCKT-1008 – Mobile App Crashes (High Priority)\",\n  \"email_body\": \"- Ticket ID: TCKT-1008\\n- User: Ethan Miller\\n- Issue: Mobile app crashes on startup\\n- Priority: High\\n- Date Submitted: 2026-05-29\\n- Status: In Progress\\n\\nIT Support Team\"\n}\n\nNow generate the JSON for the given ticket.",
